    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ditch the roles, hard counters and last hits in Sirocco. Rally your team as you <strong>swap abilities</strong> mid-match, load up <strong>auto-firing weapons</strong>, and craft strategies on the fly. No rules \u2014 just fun.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/72e3fbad761a6f215caf4308e2982801.poster.avif?t=1750089672\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/72e3fbad761a6f215caf4308e2982801.webm?t=1750089672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/72e3fbad761a6f215caf4308e2982801.mp4?t=1750089672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Creativity As Meta </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without fixed roles and hard counters, learn as you go and discover your own strategies instead of being punished for not following the strategies of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/ed3e980244c8f502190ac8df479d6a75.avif?t=1750089672\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auto-firing Arena, Not Farming Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirocco utilizes an auto-fire mechanic and economic system that promotes team fighting and positioning over last hitting NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/27e6863f91a75fe1cafeb8f5c832e102.poster.avif?t=1750089672\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/27e6863f91a75fe1cafeb8f5c832e102.webm?t=1750089672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/27e6863f91a75fe1cafeb8f5c832e102.mp4?t=1750089672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High Risk, High Reward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Ability In Sirocco Is A Skill Shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Strategy, Not Memorization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine specialized weapons, ship abilities, and ability augmentations to develop your own way to play. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer The Five Seas with your Friends by Making New Ones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sirocco, teams win, not individuals, so whether you are 10-0 or 0-10, our economic system ensures all your friends are critical to achieving victory.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ditch the roles, hard counters and last hits in Sirocco. Rally your team as you <strong>swap abilities</strong> mid-match, load up <strong>auto-firing weapons</strong>, and craft strategies on the fly. No rules \u2014 just fun.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/72e3fbad761a6f215caf4308e2982801.poster.avif?t=1750089672\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/72e3fbad761a6f215caf4308e2982801.webm?t=1750089672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/72e3fbad761a6f215caf4308e2982801.mp4?t=1750089672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Creativity As Meta </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without fixed roles and hard counters, learn as you go and discover your own strategies instead of being punished for not following the strategies of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/ed3e980244c8f502190ac8df479d6a75.avif?t=1750089672\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auto-firing Arena, Not Farming Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirocco utilizes an auto-fire mechanic and economic system that promotes team fighting and positioning over last hitting NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/27e6863f91a75fe1cafeb8f5c832e102.poster.avif?t=1750089672\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/27e6863f91a75fe1cafeb8f5c832e102.webm?t=1750089672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790090/extras/27e6863f91a75fe1cafeb8f5c832e102.mp4?t=1750089672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High Risk, High Reward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Ability In Sirocco Is A Skill Shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Strategy, Not Memorization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine specialized weapons, ship abilities, and ability augmentations to develop your own way to play. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer The Five Seas with your Friends by Making New Ones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sirocco, teams win, not individuals, so whether you are 10-0 or 0-10, our economic system ensures all your friends are critical to achieving victory.</p>",
    "short_description": "Sirocco is an infinitely replayable 5v5 arena. Rally your team as you swap abilities mid-match, craft unique builds and load up auto-firing weapons as you craft strategies on the fly. No rules \u2014 just fun.",
